{
  "Npcs.SpiderMorphMob.Desc": "You are fighting a horde of spider-morphs! A group of some two-dozen spiders and driders approaches you, all baring their teeth. A pair of large, powerful driders lead the group, their corrupt, lusty stares sending shivers up your spine. While you could probably handle them alone, you have a powerful ally in this fight - the dragoness Kiha!"
  "Npcs.SpiderMorphMob.DescHorde": "You are fighting a horde of spider-morphs! A group of some two-dozen spiders and driders approaches you, all baring their teeth. A pair of large, powerful driders lead the group, their corrupt, lusty stares sending shivers up your spine. While you'd never face such a large horde on your own, you have a powerful ally in this fight - the dragoness Kiha!"
  "Npcs.SpiderMorphMob.Name": "mob of spiders-morphs"
}
